# Install cooldown (checked on npm 12.2.0; the value is in days).
# npm only picks versions published at least 3 days ago, so a hijacked release
# is usually caught and pulled before an agent can install it.
# Lockfile installs (npm ci) are not affected.
# One-off override when you adopt a new version early:
#   npm install -D typescript@7 --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=3
